# The champion with the outranged switch armed: siegedose artillery
# shares join the production ratio only WHILE a seen ground mover
# outranges every land gun in the mix (rw_bot.policy.counter,
# ground_outranged). Built from the arty39/artyprobe18 opposition (log
# 2026-09-12): the artillery slot wins four opener seeds the hover slot
# loses, the hover slot wins twenty-plus block seeds the artillery slot
# loses, and no static goals mix satisfies both -- while on a
# zero-artillery seed this clause never fires and the match is the
# champion's bit for bit, the property the static merge could not have.
# Every other knob and every goals slot is the champion's exactly.
